{"seq":4,"slug":"governance","title":"API 治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"versioning-compatibility","title":"API 版本策略与兼容性演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/versioning-compatibility","wordCount":1144,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"contract-testing","title":"契约测试与 CI 自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/contract-testing","wordCount":1090,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"lifecycle-management","title":"API 生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/governance/lifecycle-management","wordCount":1316,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"api-治理\">API 治理</h1><p>当组织从一个 API 增长到几十个、上百个，&quot;设计得好&quot;就不够了——需要&quot;管得住&quot;。版本如何演进而不破坏消费者？契约变更如何在 CI 中自动检测？API 从设计到废弃的生命周期谁来负责？</p>\n<p>本章聚焦规模化场景下的 API 治理：版本策略与兼容性规则、契约测试与自动化门禁、全生命周期管理。这些是让 API 从&quot;一个人的作品&quot;变成&quot;组织级资产&quot;的关键制度。</p>\n"}